    "long_instructions": "## Effects Designer\r\n\r\nMake the scene use multiple random effects each time it runs.\r\n\r\n1. Review the code and ask AI Tutor how the different commands work.\r\n2. Choose at least two values to randomize, such as color, position, or sound.\r\n3. Use `randint()` to store each random value in a variable.\r\n4. Update the Theater commands to use your variables.\r\n5. Run the program several times and observe what changes.\r\n\r\n---\r\n**Range Reminders**\r\n* Color values: 0 to 255\r\n* Position values: 0 to 400\r\n* Music notes: 48 to 84",
    "start_sources": {
      "files": {
        "0": {
          "id": "0",
          "name": "main.py",
          "contents": "from theater import *\nfrom random import randint\n\n# Firework values\nred = 255\ngreen = 0\nblue = 255\n\nx = 200\ny = 115\nsize = 35\n\nnote = 72\n\n# Night sky\nset_fill_color(\"black\")\ndraw_rectangle(0, 0, 400, 400)\n\n# Moon glow\nset_fill_color(\"indigo\")\ndraw_ellipse(285, 35, 85, 85)\n\nset_fill_color(\"ivory\")\ndraw_ellipse(305, 50, 50, 50)\n\n# Background stars\nset_fill_color(\"white\")\ndraw_ellipse(35, 45, 4, 4)\ndraw_ellipse(95, 100, 3, 3)\ndraw_ellipse(165, 55, 4, 4)\ndraw_ellipse(250, 85, 3, 3)\ndraw_ellipse(365, 130, 4, 4)\n\n# Main firework\nset_stroke_color(Color(red, green, blue))\nset_stroke_width(3)\ndraw_line(x, y - size, x, y + size)\ndraw_line(x - size, y, x + size, y)\ndraw_line(x - 25, y - 25, x + 25, y + 25)\ndraw_line(x + 25, y - 25, x - 25, y + 25)\n\nset_fill_color(Color(red, green, blue))\ndraw_ellipse(x - 6, y - 6, 12, 12)\n\n# Smaller fireworks\nset_stroke_color(\"aqua\")\nset_stroke_width(2)\ndraw_line(95, 130, 95, 170)\ndraw_line(75, 150, 115, 150)\ndraw_line(82, 137, 108, 163)\ndraw_line(108, 137, 82, 163)\n\nset_stroke_color(\"gold\")\ndraw_line(310, 155, 310, 195)\ndraw_line(290, 175, 330, 175)\ndraw_line(297, 162, 323, 188)\ndraw_line(323, 162, 297, 188)\n\n# Skyline\nset_fill_color(\"gray\")\ndraw_rectangle(0, 300, 55, 100)\ndraw_rectangle(55, 270, 55, 130)\ndraw_rectangle(110, 315, 45, 85)\ndraw_rectangle(155, 250, 70, 150)\ndraw_rectangle(225, 285, 45, 115)\ndraw_rectangle(270, 235, 75, 165)\ndraw_rectangle(345, 305, 55, 95)\n\n# Rooftop details\nset_fill_color(\"silver\")\ndraw_rectangle(65, 260, 35, 10)\ndraw_rectangle(170, 240, 40, 10)\ndraw_rectangle(285, 225, 45, 10)\n\n# Windows\nset_fill_color(\"gold\")\ndraw_rectangle(20, 320, 8, 12)\ndraw_rectangle(75, 295, 8, 12)\ndraw_rectangle(130, 340, 8, 12)\ndraw_rectangle(180, 275, 8, 12)\ndraw_rectangle(205, 315, 8, 12)\ndraw_rectangle(240, 310, 8, 12)\ndraw_rectangle(295, 260, 8, 12)\ndraw_rectangle(325, 310, 8, 12)\ndraw_rectangle(365, 330, 8, 12)\n\n\n# Firework sounds\nplay_note_and_pause(72, 0.4)\nplay_note_and_pause(76, 0.4)\nplay_note_and_pause(79, 0.4)\nplay_note_and_pause(84, 0.7)\nplay()",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
